# 6. DETECTION ENGINEERING

Detection engineering creates rules that identify suspicious behavior.

Example:

```text
Multiple failed logins
        +
Successful login
        +
Unusual source
        ↓
Potential account compromise
```

A good detection should have:

- Clear logic
- Useful context
- Appropriate severity
- Low unnecessary noise
- Test coverage

---

