# 9. CONTAINMENT VS ERADICATION VS RECOVERY

| Phase | Purpose |
|---|---|
| Containment | Limit spread/impact |
| Eradication | Remove threat/root cause |
| Recovery | Restore trusted operation |

Exam trap:

> **Deleting malware is not automatically complete eradication.**

